    %% ========================================
    %% KEY SECURITY & VALIDATION CHECKPOINTS
    %% ========================================

    note1["🔐 SECURITY CHECKPOINTS:<br/>1. SHA256 checksum verification (ZIP integrity)<br/>2. File unblocking (prevent DLL load failures)<br/>3. File count validation (450 files expected)<br/>4. Database encryption (optional: SQLCipher)<br/>5. HTTPS certificate (production deployment)"]

    note2["⚠️ COMMON FAILURE POINTS:<br/>1. Skipping UNBLOCK_FILES.bat → DLL load error<br/>2. Missing .NET 8.0 runtime → Use self-contained build<br/>3. Port conflicts (5000/5001) → Configure appsettings.json<br/>4. SQLite permissions → Run as admin or grant write access<br/>5. Firewall blocking → Allow port 5000 in Windows Firewall"]

    note3["✅ VERIFICATION STEPS:<br/>1. Run VERIFY_FILES.bat → Check file existence<br/>2. Start ShiftManager.exe → Watch console output<br/>3. Open browser → http://localhost:5000<br/>4. Login as admin → Default: admin@test.com / Admin123!<br/>5. Check database → ShiftManager.db created (~500KB initial)<br/>6. Test OFFLINE shift type → Create test shift assignment"]

    %% Position notes at bottom
    ClientBrowsers -.-> note1
    note1 -.-> note2
    note2 -.-> note3
